  "description_snippet": "# Type confusion in CSSRepeatValue via IsValueList() range check leads to renderer crash\n\n## Summary\n\nA type confusion in the CSS value type dispatch system causes `CSSRepeatValue` to be misidentified as `CSSValueList`. When a gap decoration property using `repeat()` syntax is set as an inline style"
